@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@channelId = protected-channel-demo

### Notification channels: read remains open
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/channels

### Notification channel create: denied without RBAC principal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/channels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Denied Webhook",
  "type": "webhook",
  "enabled": true,
  "config": {
    "url": "https://example.local/denied"
  }
}

### Notification channel create: allowed with notification:manage
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/channels
Content-Type: application/json
x-rbac-permissions: notification:manage

{
  "name": "Protected Webhook",
  "type": "webhook",
  "enabled": true,
  "config": {
    "url": "https://example.local/webhook"
  }
}

### Notification channel update: denied without RBAC principal
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/channels/{{channelId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": false
}

### Notification channel update: allowed with notification:manage
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/channels/{{channelId}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-rbac-permissions: notification:manage

{
  "enabled": false
}

### Notification channel delete: denied without RBAC principal
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/channels/{{channelId}}

### Notification channel delete: allowed with notification:manage
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/channels/{{channelId}}
x-rbac-permissions: notification:manage
